=== fm-watch-parked-run.test.sh ===
ok - a parked run wakes once per episode with task, step, duration and finding count, under a declared pause
ok - the wake reason words plural findings and hour-long waits
ok - a parked run under the threshold, a working run, a gate with no worker clock, a non-run source, an unreadable run and a finished run all stay silent
ok - a task with no run keeps the 60s cadence, and scout tasks are never read
ok - an oldest-due parked run is read before the per-poll cap
ok - a run-only terminal read skips forge access
